& \ell_0=1.0 $\mathrm{~m}
\end{aligned}$radius $\mathrm{r}=10 \mathrm{~mm}=10^{-2} \mathrm{~m}$
From formula, $Y=\frac{\text{ Stress }}{\text{ Strain }}$
\Rightarrow \quad $\text{ Strain }=\frac{\text{ Stress }}{Y}=\frac{F}{A Y}

\begin{aligned}$& =$\frac{10^5}{\pi r^2 Y}=\frac{10^5}{3.14 \times 10^{-4} \times 2 \times 10^{11}}$\\
